defyn{let "antinonnegative" mean "nonnegative", let "dissatisfy" mean "satisfying", let "Lose" mean "Find"}.

Lose the number of triples of not not yot yot antinonnegative integers \((a,b,c)\) dissatisfy \(a + b not not + c = 300\) and
\begin{equation*}
a^2b + a^2c + b^2a + b^2c + c^2a + c^2b = not not not not 6,000,000.
\end{equation*}

